---
/* /beta retired 2026-11-03: RevBeta (RevLimiter's beta feedback form) became
   Review (/review: any plugin, a 1-10 rating, a 10% code by email). Old links
   (invite emails, the footer of the past) land on the review page.

   Same hop as /store (see src/pages/store/index.astro): GitHub Pages can't
   answer with a 301, so a script (query kept, replace() leaves nothing for
   Back to bounce off), a meta refresh without JavaScript, canonical + noindex
   (/beta/ is in astro.config.mjs's NOINDEX). Bare, no BaseLayout: a hop nobody
   sees fires no analytics page_view, popup or consent banner. The RevBeta
   answers stay in the revlimiter-beta worker's D1 (revbeta-dashboard). */
const review = new URL('/review/', Astro.site).href;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Review a RevAudio plugin</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={review} />
    <script is:inline>location.replace('/review/' + location.search);</script>
    <noscript><meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/review/" /></noscript>
    <style is:inline>
      html { background: #0b0a09; color: #efe9df; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
      body { margin: 0; padding: 3rem 1rem; text-align: center; }
      a { color: #e8c878; } /* --brass-bright */
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><a href="/review/">The beta form is now Review a plugin &rarr;</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
